    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight text quality scorer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_text_quality_score" kindref="compound">TextQualityScore</ref></computeroutput> fields in a single linear pass over the input:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Count bytes and whitespace-separated tokens.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Detect language via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_default_language_detector" kindref="compound">DefaultLanguageDetector</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Evaluate boilerplate heuristics.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Uses <computeroutput>utils::Normalizer</computeroutput> internally to fold umlauts before tokenisation so that German texts are handled correctly.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: stateless; instances may be shared across threads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
